<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<meta name="color-scheme" content="light">
<title>The Research Roundup – {{ month_label }}</title>
<style>
  body { margin: 0; padding: 0; background: #f3f4f6; font-family: Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif; color: #1f2937; }
  .wrapper { width: 100%; background: #f3f4f6; }
  .container { width: 600px; max-width: 600px; background: #ffffff; }
  .header { padding: 32px 32px 24px 32px; border-bottom: 3px solid #111827; }
  .kicker { font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 1.5px; text-transform: uppercase; color: #6b7280; margin: 0 0 8px 0; }
  .masthead { font-size: 32px; line-height: 38px; font-weight: bold; color: #111827; margin: 0; }
  .tagline { font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; color: #4b5563; margin: 8px 0 0 0; }
  .note { padding: 24px 32px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 25px; color: #374151; }
  .note-label { font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: 1px; text-transform: uppercase; color: #111827; margin: 0 0 8px 0; }
  .card { padding: 24px 32px; border-top: 1px solid #e5e7eb; }
  .meta { font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; color: #6b7280; margin: 0 0 10px 0; }
  .badge { display: inline-block; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 11px; font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: 0.5px; padding: 3px 8px; border-radius: 3px; }
  .headline { font-size: 21px; line-height: 27px; font-weight: bold; color: #111827; margin: 0 0 6px 0; }
  .title { font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 19px; color: #4b5563; margin: 0 0 12px 0; }
  .summary { font-size: 16px; line-height: 25px; color: #1f2937; margin: 0 0 14px 0; }
  .label { font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-weight: bold; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 1px; color: #111827; margin: 0 0 6px 0; }
  .takeaways { margin: 0 0 14px 0; padding: 0 0 0 20px; font-size: 15px; line-height: 23px; color: #1f2937; }
  .why { background: #f9fafb; border-left: 3px solid #111827; padding: 12px 16px; font-size: 15px; line-height: 23px; color: #1f2937; }
  .focus { font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; line-height: 18px; color: #6b7280; margin: 10px 0 0 0; }
  .abstract-only { font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 11px; font-style: italic; color: #6b7280; }
  .link { font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-weight: bold; color: #1d4ed8; text-decoration: none; }
  .footer { padding: 24px 32px 32px 32px; border-top: 3px solid #111827; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; line-height: 18px; color: #6b7280; }
  @media only screen and (max-width: 620px) {
    .container { width: 100% !important; }
    .header, .note, .card, .footer { padding-left: 18px !important; padding-right: 18px !important; }
    .masthead { font-size: 26px !important; line-height: 32px !important; }
    .headline { font-size: 19px !important; line-height: 25px !important; }
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<table role="presentation" class="wrapper" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0">
<tr><td align="center" style="padding: 24px 0;">
<table role="presentation" class="container" width="600" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0">

  <tr><td class="header">
    <p class="kicker">{{ month_label }} · Issue {{ issue_number }}</p>
    <h1 class="masthead">The Research Roundup</h1>
    <p class="tagline">New economics research for Global Markets: rates, FX, credit, macro and emerging markets.</p>
  </td></tr>

  <tr><td class="note">
    <p class="note-label">Editor's note</p>
    {% for para in note_paragraphs %}<p style="margin: 0 0 12px 0;">{{ para }}</p>{% endfor %}
  </td></tr>

  {% for p in papers %}
  {% set tag = tag_colours[p.market_focus] %}
  <tr><td class="card">
    <p class="meta">
      <span class="badge" style="background: {{ tag.bg }}; color: {{ tag.fg }};">{{ p.market_focus }}</span>
      &nbsp;{{ p.source_name }} · {{ p.published_label }}
    </p>
    <h2 class="headline">{{ p.headline }}</h2>
    <p class="title">{{ p.title }}{% if p.authors %} — {{ p.authors_label }}{% endif %}</p>
    <p class="summary">{{ p.summary }}</p>
    <p class="label">Key takeaways</p>
    <ul class="takeaways">
      {% for t in p.takeaways %}<li>{{ t }}</li>{% endfor %}
    </ul>
    <div class="why"><strong>Why it matters for markets.</strong> {{ p.why_it_matters }}</div>
    <p class="focus"><strong>Market focus: {{ p.market_focus }}.</strong> {{ p.focus_rationale }}</p>
    <p style="margin: 14px 0 0 0;">
      <a class="link" href="{{ p.url }}">Read the paper &rarr;</a>
      {% if p.paywalled %}&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="abstract-only">Summary based on abstract</span>{% endif %}
    </p>
  </td></tr>
  {% endfor %}

  <tr><td class="footer">
    <p style="margin: 0 0 8px 0;"><strong>How this issue was made.</strong> We monitor {{ sources_monitored }} sources: the top five economics journals, G10 and European central banks, the twelve regional Federal Reserve Banks, NBER, the IMF and the BIS. This month {{ papers_screened }} new papers were screened by a language model for relevance and market focus (EM, DM or Transversal), and an AI editor chose {{ papers|length }} of the {{ pool_size }} strongest candidates. Summaries are written from titles and abstracts only; for paywalled journals and NBER, we never use the full text.</p>
    <p style="margin: 0;">EM: emerging and developing economies. DM: advanced economies. Transversal: global, cross-country or methodological.</p>
  </td></tr>

</table>
</td></tr>
</table>
</body>
</html>
